cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "meta-analysis.cz: harmonised estimate-level data from meta-analyses in economics"
message: >-
  LICENCE SCOPE: the CC-BY-4.0 below covers the COMPILATION only — the index,
  codebooks, harmonisation mappings and documentation. It does NOT cover the
  underlying research datasets, their CSV/Parquet format conversions, or the
  papers' own replication code; those were assembled by their own author teams
  and their rights are unchanged. See https://meta-analysis.cz/LICENSE.
  If you use this collection, please cite it. If you use an individual dataset,
  you must also cite the paper it was assembled for — every dataset entry in
  /api/v1/datasets.json carries that paper's title, authors and DOI, and a
  rights_status field. Attribution is not the same as permission.
