repository-code: "https://github.com/tjhavranek/meta-analysis.cz"
url: "https://meta-analysis.cz"
abstract: >-
  Estimate-level data from meta-analyses in economics and the social sciences,
  with the study and design characteristics hand-coded for each original paper.
  Forty-four datasets holding 65,349 rows in the converted source
  files, 61,294 estimates after each paper's own analysis
  selection, and a harmonised table pooling 54,076 of them across
  39 literatures. Each dataset ships a column-level codebook. Column
  mappings were resolved arithmetically, by requiring that the effect divided by
  its standard error reproduce the t-statistic each dataset already reports, and
  otherwise taken from each paper's own replication code.
keywords:
  - meta-analysis
  - publication bias
  - research synthesis
  - economics
  - effect size
  - replication
license: CC-BY-4.0
